WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.252
Claude, I don't want hackers getting into my app,

2
00:00:03.272 --> 00:00:04.352
so please…

3
00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:05.882
Set up proper authentication.

4
00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:07.282
Hide API keys.

5
00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:08.533
Secure my database.

6
00:00:08.702 --> 00:00:10.169
Enforce HTTPS.

7
00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:11.200
Hash passwords.

8
00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:13.314
Validate my forms server-side.

9
00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:15.094
Protect against XSS.

10
00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.102
Log and monitor suspicious activity.

11
00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:18.590
Lock down my admin routes.

12
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.918
Use parameterized queries.

13
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.410
Check my environment variables.

14
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:22.419
Add rate limiting.

15
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.394
Restrict my CORS settings.

16
00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:25.794
Add security headers.

17
00:00:25.814 --> 00:00:27.575
Secure my session cookies.

18
00:00:27.595 --> 00:00:29.066
Add CSRF protection.

19
00:00:29.086 --> 00:00:30.872
Make password-reset links expire.

20
00:00:30.892 --> 00:00:32.907
Restrict file upload types and sizes.

21
00:00:32.927 --> 00:00:34.505
Verify prices and payments.

22
00:00:34.525 --> 00:00:36.137
Disable production debug mode.

23
00:00:36.157 --> 00:00:37.772
Update vulnerable dependencies.

24
00:00:37.792 --> 00:00:39.172
Remove unused packages.

25
00:00:39.192 --> 00:00:40.569
Check for exposed files.

26
00:00:40.592 --> 00:00:42.765
Scan my Git history for leaked secrets.

27
00:00:42.785 --> 00:00:44.820
Revoke and replace compromised keys.

28
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.304
Run a thorough security review.

29
00:00:46.324 --> 00:00:50.080
And finally, test the protections, and give me a report of findings and fixes.

30
00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.232
Every project needs a pre-launch security toolkit.

31
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:55.361
We build it into every app before it goes live.

32
00:00:55.531 --> 00:00:59.026
Learn more at ntlofnyc.com.
